[en.FOCUS_C01_EMPIRE_ACADEMY]
Imperial Academy of Science and Magic

[en.FOCUS_C01_EMPIRE_ACADEMY_desc]
After the opening of the school for unicorns and the advancement of education reform, the Empire’s education and scientific and magical research are thriving, and it is time to establish a new research institution.\nThe newly established Imperial Academy of Science and Magic will be committed to promoting the Empire’s scientific and magical research, and providing strong support for the development of the Empire’s science and magic, we hope.

[zh.FOCUS_C01_EMPIRE_ACADEMY]
帝国科学与魔法研究院

[zh.FOCUS_C01_EMPIRE_ACADEMY_desc]
随着独角兽学院开放、教育改革推进，帝国的教育与科学魔法研究蒸蒸日上，是时候组建一个新的研究机构了。\n新成立的帝国科学与魔法研究院将致力于推动帝国的科学与魔法研究，为帝国的科学与魔法发展提供强有力的支持，我们希望是。

